[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:109. A Good Idea]
[00:00.820] Lesson 109. | 第109课。
[00:03.535] Shall I make some coffee, Jane? | 简，我来煮些咖啡好吗？
[00:06.615] That's a good idea, Betty. | 好主意，贝蒂。
[00:09.475] It's ready. | 好了。
[00:11.500] Do you want any milk? | 你要牛奶吗？
[00:13.380] Just a little, please. | 只要一点点，谢谢。
[00:15.690] What about some sugar? | 糖呢？
[00:18.060] Two teaspoonfuls? | 两茶匙吗？
[00:18.140] No, less than that. | 不，少于两茶匙。
[00:22.320] One and a half teaspoonfuls, please. | 一茶匙半，谢谢。
[00:25.490] That's enough for me. | 对我来说够了。
[00:28.055] That was very nice. | 真好。
[00:30.840] Would you like some more? | 你还要些吗？
[00:32.570] Yes, please. | 是的，谢谢。
[00:34.625] I'd like a cigarette, too. | 我也想抽支烟。
[00:37.850] May I have one? | 我可以来一支吗？
[00:39.435] Of course. | 当然。
[00:40.885] I think there are a few in that box. | 我想那个盒子里有一些。
[00:44.245] I'm afraid it's empty. | 恐怕是空的。
[00:46.780] What a pity! | 多可惜啊！
[00:48.180] It doesn't matter. | 没关系。
[00:50.490] Have a biscuit instead. | 吃块饼干吧。
[00:53.520] Eat more and smoke less. | 多吃点，少抽烟。
[00:56.285] That's very good advice. | 那是很好的建议。